3566,34.84588606]}}],"display_comment_original":"宇治田原町周辺には、近世村の記憶として高尾村、荒木村、岩本村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には寺社や信仰の場、城跡や陣屋跡、史跡や遺跡に関わる場所が見え、山口城跡、岩本城跡、田原御栗栖跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、高尾村、荒木村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに水辺の由緒を示す歴史案内板も見つかるかもしれない。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":["小笠原秀政"],"notable_people":["小笠原秀政","永谷宗円"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["宇治田原城","岩本城","雙栗天神社","猿丸神社","茶宗明神社","御栗栖神社","脇神神社","禅定寺"],"specialties":["宇治茶","京野菜"],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%87%E6%B2%BB%E7%94%B0%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%BA","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q8192119","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11550354","https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E5%B0%8F%E7%AC%A0%E5%8E%9F%E7%A7%80%E6%94%BF&keyword=%E5%AE%87%E6%B2%BB%E7%94%B0%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%BA"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"宇治田原町","wikipedia_revision_id":"110741096","wikidata_qid":"Q1203224","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%87%E6%B2%BB%E7%94%B0%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%BA","japan_search_query_url":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E5%B0%8F%E7%AC%A0%E5%8E%9F%E7%A7%80%E6%94%BF&keyword=%E5%AE%87%E6%B2%BB%E7%94%B0%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%BA","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}